menu "Dirigible"

    config DIRIGIBLE_VOICE
        bool "Voice input (T-Deck mic, transcribed by Hester)"
        default y
        help
            Record a clip on the T-Deck's ES7210 microphone and have Hester
            transcribe it (POST /voice/transcribe) into the reply, capture,
            Hester or compose box it belongs to.  Nothing is ever sent by
            voice.  On since it was checked on a device (2026-09-28): the
            ES7210 answers at 0x40 on LilyGO's pins, in TDM with the two mics
            on slots 0 and 1.  Links espressif/esp_codec_dev's ES7210 driver.

endmenu
